Package: mutt
Title: Curated Microbiome Taxonomic Profiles and Microbial Load Measurements
Version: 0.1.0.9001
Authors@R: c(person("Maxwell", "Konnaris", email = "mak6930@psu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Justin", "Silverman", email = "JustinSilverman@psu.edu", role = c("aut", "ctb")))
Description: Provides processed microbiome study data pairing taxonomic profiles
    with microbial-load measurements. Downloads only the studies requested and
    saves local copies for later use. Downloads are checked before use. Source
    information and links to processing scripts explain how each study was
    prepared.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Silverman-Lab/mutt
BugReports: https://github.com/Silverman-Lab/mutt/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: digest, jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr, phyloseq,
    TreeSummarizedExperiment, S4Vectors
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
